<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ 48-0 AFTER TRAILING ENGLAND BY 259.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ 48-0 AFTER TRAILING ENGLAND BY 259.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand were 48 without loss at the close of the third day of the second cricket test on Saturday after trailing England by 259 on the first innings.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand 124 (D. Patel 45, D. Gough 5-40, A. Caddick 4-45) and 48 for no wicket (B.Young 32 not out).</p>
<p>England 383 (N. Hussain 64, G. Thorpe 108, J. Crawley 56, A. Stewart 52, S. Doull 5-75).</p>
</text>
